; Each frame's filters. Eleven cards a frame in: j, u and end (from framer), and its segment's c, ma, mb, uon, vm,
; gl, cf and af (from spread); per frame four cards out to glide (a, b, uu, g) and two to the level (snd, V). A frame
; j < c is the closure: filter cf, sounding if cf is a voice bar, else silent (snd 0, or 9 at the very end). Frame 0
; of a segment with af is aspirated: af, unvoiced. Any other frame speaks through ma to mb (by u if uon), voiced if
; vm, with glides if gl.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            frm     INP   j        03-26: a frame: its place, and its segment's cards
  04                    INP   u
  05                    INP   e
  06                    INP   c
  07                    INP   ma
  08                    INP   mb
  09                    INP   uon
  10                    INP   vm
  11                    INP   gl
  12                    INP   cf
  13                    INP   af
  14                    CLA   z
  15                    STO   g
  16                    STO   uu
  17                    CLA   00
  18                    STO   snd
  19                    STO   v
  20                    CLA   j
  21                    SUB   c
  22                    TAC   clo
  23                    CLA   j
  24                    SUB   00
  25                    TAC   j0
  26                    JMP   norm
  27            j0      CLA   af       27-35: aspirated
  28                    SUB   00
  29                    TAC   norm
  30                    CLA   af
  31                    STO   a
  32                    STO   b
  33                    CLA   z
  34                    STO   v
  35                    JMP   out
  36            clo     CLA   cf       36-49: the closure
  37                    STO   a
  38                    STO   b
  39                    SUB   00
  40                    TAC   sil
  41                    JMP   out
  42            sil     CLA   z
  43                    STO   snd
  44                    CLA   e
  45                    SUB   00
  46                    TAC   out
  47                    CLA   c9
  48                    STO   snd
  49                    JMP   out
  50            norm    CLA   ma       50-62: the rest
  51                    STO   a
  52                    CLA   mb
  53                    STO   b
  54                    CLA   vm
  55                    STO   v
  56                    CLA   gl
  57                    STO   g
  58                    CLA   uon
  59                    SUB   00
  60                    TAC   out
  61                    CLA   u
  62                    STO   uu
  63            out     OUT   a        63-88: the cards
  64                    OUT   b
  65                    OUT   uu
  66                    OUT   g
  67            ls      OUT   snd
  68            lv      OUT   v
  69                    JMP   frm
  70            c       DATA  0
  71            ma      DATA  0
  72            mb      DATA  0
  73            uon     DATA  0
  74            vm      DATA  0
  75            gl      DATA  0
  76            cf      DATA  0
  77            af      DATA  0
  78            j       DATA  0
  79            u       DATA  0
  80            e       DATA  0
  81            a       DATA  0
  82            b       DATA  0
  83            uu      DATA  0
  84            g       DATA  0
  85            snd     DATA  0
  86            v       DATA  0
  87            z       DATA  0
  88            c9      DATA  9
